# Moment of Valor, first mode: "Untap target creature. It gets +1/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn." Bot1's Llanowar
# Elves is tapped for the green that pays for the spell ({2}{W}: Plains, Mox Pearl, the Elves' G, pool empty), so it is cast on
# a tapped creature: afterwards the Elves is untapped, 2/1 (power +1, toughness unchanged) and indestructible (CR 702.12b). On
# Bot2's turn the bonus is gone again (CR 514.2).

